Z||000012||Songman||06-16-2001||11:59 AM||||Here are two of my old cars. This was the day I went to get the Judge. Bought it from a buddy of mine that owns a wrecker service.<BR>PHS-documented RamAir IV with a 4-speed.<P>Nice Monte in the picture too. Is that about an 85? I have a white 87 Aerocoupe too.<P> <IMG SRC="http://members.home.com/tnfieros/pontiacs.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
