Z||000016||Pontiaddict||06-17-2001||04:53 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Songman:<BR><B>I found a guy that will sell me a 67 2+2 convertible for $1000! I haven't seen it yet, but he says it has 3x2s and a 4-speed!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I hate you.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> I missed out on a 67 Bonnie convertible last week for only a grand. It was probably a beater though.<P>DXR, I'll guess that the 1st red car is a 64 Malibu ...<BR>the second looks like a 72 Chevelle ...<BR>And the blue camaro looks a little too blurry to be certain, but I'll say it's another 68 because it looks like it has the side marker lights. I could be wrong on all counts though.<p>[This message has been edited by Pontiaddict (edited 06-17-2001).]||||reg||1
